# INVWINPC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the status bar's
# panels as wide as their texts.  ADMIN adds OPERATOR, eight wide capitals,
# at level 2, logs out, whose user panel empties, and OPERATOR logs in,
# changing the password as a new user must: every panel but the help
# panel holds its whole text, none cut (CUT of TDRV.H).  The end by
# Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPC.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/framchk.py
# checks it with every frame.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-A U INS
T OPERATOR
K TAB
T Wide Operator
K TAB
T lab
K TAB
T 2
K TAB
T Wide1986
K TAB
T Wide1986
K ENTER
S ADDED
K ALT-F L STAB
S LOGOUT
T OPERATOR
K TAB
T Wide1986
K ENTER
T Wide1986
K TAB
T Wider1986
K TAB
T Wider1986
K ENTER
S OPERATOR
K ALT-F X
